---
title: Basic Pasta with Sausage
servings: 5
prep time: 5 minutes
cook time: 15 minutes
difficulty: easy
cuisine: finnish
protein: mixed
course: dinner
tags:
- comfort-food
- kid-friendly
- mild
- pasta-dish
- quick
- weekday
equipment:
- pot
- frying pan
- colander
---

Bring salted water to a boil in a #pot{} and cook the @pasta{500%g} until tender, about ~{8%minutes} to ~{10%minutes}. Drain in a #colander{}.

Meanwhile, slice the @nakki sausages{400%g} into bite-sized pieces. Cook them in a #frying pan{} over medium heat for ~{5%minutes}, stirring occasionally, until hot and lightly browned.

Return the drained pasta to the pot. Add the sausages and @butter{25%g}, then stir until the butter melts and everything is mixed together. Taste and season with @salt{} if needed.

Serve hot.
